WEBVTT

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:39.840
In search of the Darkstar weapon,
we arrive in the kingdoms of...

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:42.280
...Alto and Baritone, which
have been at war for ages!

00:01:42.810 --> 00:01:46.270
Okay, let's grab the legendary
magical vessels they each have!

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:51.720
That was the plan, but why do
we have to act like thieves?!

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:55.120
Besides, these aren't
even Darkstar weapons!

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:18.650
Why does he have <i>that</i> thing?!

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:24.080
We may not know the circumstances,
but we shouldn't underestimate him!

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:35.000
C'mon... Hurry up and give
me the vessels! Or else...

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:37.730
Now look...
What do you mean "or else?!"

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:40.830
First of all, that "blade" isn't
exactly that threatening!

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:46.510
Never mind that! We've got the
armies of Alto and Baritone after us!

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:48.670
Since you're waving that
dangerous thing around...

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:51.210
...they'll never let
you have the vessels!

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:58.020
Hey, everyone! Here's the REAL crook
who's after your magical vessels!

00:02:59.190 --> 00:03:02.160
Go ahead and smash
him up for me, please!

00:03:02.230 --> 00:03:05.060
Hold it! What do you
mean "the real crook?!"

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:10.690
King Alto!
This is all your doing!

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:14.000
You tempted my darling
Marco into stealing our vessel!

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:16.200
Damn your daughter!

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:17.470
Wh- What did you say?!

00:03:17.740 --> 00:03:21.910
You dare to place the
blame for this plot on us?!

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:24.470
The one who manipulated
my daughter's pure heart...

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:26.650
...was that miserable
brat of yours!

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:32.160
I'm not going to take that!
Prepare for bombardment!

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:35.090
Prepare our own
bombardment as well!

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:38.130
Your target, of course,
are the Baritone forces!

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:41.400
They're so wrapped up in
their fight they won't listen.

00:03:41.470 --> 00:03:43.160
Oh, for crying out loud...

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:48.870
Can't you two say
something to them?

00:03:48.940 --> 00:03:51.460
The King and the Queen
are your parents, after all.

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:55.070
Agh! S-S-Stop it!
Stop it! Stop it!

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:04.580
Hey, you guys!
What are you trying to do?!

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:09.020
Well... Everyone's fighting
over these, right?

00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:17.500
My mom and Sera's dad and everyone
just fight over each other's vessel.

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:23.610
So it'd be better...
It'd be better if they didn't exist!

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:25.970
These stupid things!

00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:28.080
These stupid things!

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:30.210
Excuse me?

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:31.580
Marco...

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:35.820
Did you hear that, everyone?

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:39.750
What a gallant and
beautiful heart he has!

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:42.120
Marco...

00:04:43.890 --> 00:04:44.790
Sera...

00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:49.490
Marco... You're so cool.

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:54.300
Oh, man... Leave it to a kid to
just jump to conclusions like that!

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:57.400
Besides, it starts making
<i>us</i> look like bad guys, too.

00:05:03.180 --> 00:05:08.210
Would you people all just shut up?!
I hate it when talk turns complicated!

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:15.550
If you're just going to break them,
why not give them to me?

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:17.520
Okay?

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:26.970
No!

00:05:42.550 --> 00:05:44.520
Vanishing! It's vanishing!

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:47.350
What's happening?!

00:05:48.190 --> 00:05:50.350
The... The magic vessels...

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:10.040
What...

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:13.410
What just happened?
What did you guys do?!

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:17.380
I... I dunno...
I didn't do anything.

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:19.320
It was the power of love!

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:20.750
Love?!

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:25.860
Yeah! The pure love Marco and
I share made a miracle happen!

00:06:25.930 --> 00:06:27.760
Uh... Ri-i-ight...

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:29.860
Is that true?

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:31.530
Don't ask me!

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:41.440
How rare... Artifacts from the
War of the Gods and Monsters.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.310
Gods and Monsters?!

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:45.640
The war which was fought in
the forgotten ancient times.

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:48.720
The War of the
Gods and Monsters...

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:51.620
...in which Shabranigdo
fought with Ceiphied.

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:56.050
Someone apparently made these
magical vessels at that time.

00:06:56.590 --> 00:06:58.190
Through some unknown means...

00:06:58.260 --> 00:07:02.360
...a great deal of magical power
has been sealed into them.

00:07:02.430 --> 00:07:04.330
The power of the Gods...

00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:05.800
...and the Monsters.

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:10.200
Yes. Dark power
and godly power...

00:07:10.270 --> 00:07:12.970
Godly power means
holy magic, right?

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:14.610
Do you know any?

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:18.210
No... At the very least,
a shrine maiden of Seyruun...

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:24.590
...can't call upon holy magic.
The art was lost 1000 years ago.

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:27.560
Now, the shrine maidens
and priests of Seyruun...

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:30.420
...are just shells of
what they used to be.

00:07:30.490 --> 00:07:33.490
That's why someone like Filia,
who can use holy magic, is so much...

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:36.730
...more powerful than me, even
though we're both shrine maidens.

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:39.360
It's kind of
infuriating, actually.

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:43.140
I see... This gets even
more interesting.

00:07:43.840 --> 00:07:47.680
And with these two vessels,
you apparently generate power...

00:07:47.740 --> 00:07:52.150
...when the holy magic and the
black magic is fused together.

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:54.540
Magical fusion?!

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:56.450
You must be joking!

00:07:56.790 --> 00:08:00.780
You can't fuse black magic
with our holy magic! No!

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:03.350
I get ill just thinking about it!

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:06.500
Hey! This is no time to
be close-minded!

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:08.760
We may not know exactly
what this magic is...

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:11.930
...but we DO know
it affects their weapon!

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:15.900
Yes. It can neutralize
other powers.

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:18.610
A power to neutralize
Overworld weapons.

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:21.200
Light-Dark Fusion magic...

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:23.440
Here they come!

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:25.850
Well, if you'll excuse me.

00:08:31.420 --> 00:08:33.410
Don't underestimate me!

00:08:52.810 --> 00:08:54.070
Sera!

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:55.970
Marco!

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:03.020
Well? My blade threatening
enough for you now?!

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:05.980
Well, it's certainly
effective, isn't it?

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:12.420
I'll make your heads a
present to Lord Valgaav!

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:29.580
Don't try anything funny!
I won't show you any mercy!

00:09:29.760 --> 00:09:32.160
Jillas! Hurry up and
get those vessels...

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:33.790
...away from the two kids!

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:36.230
Aye, aye, sir!

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:42.890
Zel! Amelia!

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:43.800
Gotcha!

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:44.530
Me, too!

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:59.150
Hey! That's pretty dangerous to
just be swung around like that!

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:01.280
Don't you even know
how to use it right?

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:03.150
Who cares about that?!

00:10:03.230 --> 00:10:07.530
As long as I'm helpful to Lord Valgaav,
who cares what happens to YOU?

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:09.790
Doesn't have much
sense, does he?

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:13.890
If that's how you feel, then I'm
not holding anything back, either!

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:16.900
I already told you,
those vessels are mine!

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:19.510
Well, isn't that interesting?

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:31.910
I hope those two are all right.

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:35.320
For them to be so worried
about their kingdoms...

00:10:35.390 --> 00:10:37.620
That royal breeding really
shows, doesn't it?!

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:38.960
Oh! There they are!

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:45.130
Hey! Wake up!

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:50.870
Where am I?

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:56.100
Thank goodness!
They're both all right!

00:10:57.610 --> 00:11:00.340
Marco! Thank goodness
you're okay, Marco!

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:03.480
Oh, if you'd died,
I couldn't go on living!

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:09.320
Because... Because...
You're everything to me!

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:11.990
Oh, isn't it moving?

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:13.420
Yes.

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:15.290
Shut up...

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:18.670
Just shut up!

00:11:19.770 --> 00:11:21.930
Marco, what did you say?

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:23.840
I've had enough of this!

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:27.670
First of all, it's all your fault, Sera!
That all this trouble started!

00:11:28.010 --> 00:11:33.210
Huh? What? Didn't you
agree with me before?

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:36.780
No, I didn't!
I said it couldn't be helped.

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:40.120
What are you saying?
That now you!

00:11:47.030 --> 00:11:48.090
Get down!

00:11:53.640 --> 00:11:56.830
Surprised?
This is my special gun!

00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:59.510
You can't escape now!

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:03.740
Now hand those
things over! Move it!

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:06.940
That "gun" is just
another cheap weapon!

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:08.510
But they have so many of them!

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:13.350
Yeah. It may be cheap, but I wouldn't
want to take the lumps they'd give me.

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:15.290
FI RE...

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:18.790
Miss Amelia!

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:21.030
That hurt!

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:23.860
Wow! It really DOES
give you lumps!

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:26.230
What do we do? Try a big spell?

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:31.140
No. No reason to for
cannon fodder like these guys.

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:33.240
Let's have a
little fun with them.

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:34.110
Mr. Zelgadis!

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:47.250
Hmm... Get 'em!

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:22.120
Guns...

00:13:52.190 --> 00:13:53.160
...are used like THAT!

00:14:07.440 --> 00:14:08.930
What now?! Can't see, can you?!

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:11.000
<i>Heh... You fool.</i>

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:13.870
Gimme those magic vessels!

00:14:14.710 --> 00:14:15.970
I won't let you!

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:18.900
Vis-Fan Rank!

00:14:22.220 --> 00:14:23.850
Don't just stand there!
Get them!

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:26.390
Come and get us!

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:36.400
You hear me?! Don't harm
the prince or the princess!

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:39.400
Shoot! Shoot! Shoot them all!

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:40.860
Father!

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:41.840
Mother!

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:47.770
Heh... At last they've come.

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:51.250
They finally understand
Marco and Sera's feelings!

00:14:52.380 --> 00:14:55.080
Oh, come on!
We're on THEl R side!

00:14:55.150 --> 00:14:57.680
They don't understand AT ALL!

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:04.390
There's no way you can win!

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:07.390
Jeez... He isn't even thinking
about what he's doing...

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:08.900
...and that makes
him hard to stop!

00:15:09.070 --> 00:15:11.360
Lina! Can I use my sword on him?

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:15.630
Forget it! If you draw the Sword of
Light now, who knows what'll happen!

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:16.870
Look!

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:26.980
What's happening?!

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:29.380
Listen, you!
Drop that weapon right now!

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:31.850
It won't leave my hands!

00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:46.770
Mother!

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:47.890
Father!

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:49.000
What is it?

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:50.330
Miss Lina and the others...

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:03.050
Xellos!

00:16:06.590 --> 00:16:08.060
Help me!

00:16:09.090 --> 00:16:11.120
Man, he must be
REALLY mad at us!

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:14.760
No. He's starting to lose
control of his weapon!

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:15.960
What?

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:19.760
Huh? Hey! What gives?!

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:20.700
Gourry!

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:27.130
What's that?
This terror it's pushing up...

00:16:28.510 --> 00:16:32.310
Is this the true face
of the Darkstar weapons?

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:36.350
It would seem that, in this
situation, all we can do...

00:16:36.420 --> 00:16:40.050
...is activate the magical
vessels again.

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:43.090
Magic power seems
to be the key here.

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:44.320
You mean us?

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:47.230
Hold it. If we have to
fuse magical power here...

00:16:47.300 --> 00:16:50.530
...can't a Monster like Xellos
and a dragon like Filia do it?

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:53.430
There's no way I can do that!

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:56.840
Even if I could, I wouldn't
do it with Xellos!

00:16:56.970 --> 00:17:00.200
I couldn't do it as a
priestess of the Dragon race...

00:17:00.280 --> 00:17:02.140
...and not as a
living thing, either!

00:17:02.210 --> 00:17:03.580
You piece of filth!

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:07.680
Oh, my. Isn't that a coincidence?
I was just thinking myself...

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:12.810
...that I'd never do that
with a selfish dragon!

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:18.620
No choice now! Too bad for him,
but I'm gonna blast the island!

00:17:19.060 --> 00:17:20.190
A Dragon Slave?!

00:17:20.460 --> 00:17:24.660
If I hit him straight on, he'd be toast.
But, if I aim at his feet, then maybe...

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:28.930
Let's do it, Amelia!

00:17:29.010 --> 00:17:32.840
Right! Let the power of the
love we share make this work!

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:35.270
Um, uh...
Anyway, here goes!

00:17:35.340 --> 00:17:36.170
Right!

00:17:41.550 --> 00:17:45.610
"Darkness beyond twilight,
crimson beyond blood that flows!"

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:49.250
"Buried in the flow of time.
In thy great name..."

00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:53.020
"...I pledge myself to darkness!"

00:17:58.270 --> 00:18:05.040
"Let all the fools who
stand before us be destroyed..."

00:18:07.780 --> 00:18:10.250
"...by the power you and I possess!"

00:18:22.430 --> 00:18:24.020
It... It's gone?

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:33.690
What happened?
Hey! It went out!

00:18:33.770 --> 00:18:35.240
What's goin' on here?! Hey!

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:36.400
Sorry, pal...

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:38.800
...but it's too
late to stop now!

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:40.600
DRAGON SLAVE!!!

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:44.840
You gotta be kidding!

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:54.620
Serves you right for picking
on a helpless girl like me!

00:18:54.690 --> 00:18:56.420
Hope you learned a lesson!

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:58.480
Who was picking on who, here?

00:19:05.630 --> 00:19:07.300
What's that?!

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:35.620
Man, talk about your
fancy unveilings!

00:19:35.700 --> 00:19:40.800
So, this is how Altro and
Baritone would be connected.

00:19:40.870 --> 00:19:43.130
"When the two vessels
are brought together..."

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:45.540
"...a new road shall
be opened," it says.

00:19:45.610 --> 00:19:47.540
In other words,
when the power...

00:19:47.610 --> 00:19:49.640
...long ago sealed into
the vessels was released.

00:19:49.780 --> 00:19:52.910
But why was it sealed like that?

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:59.860
It goes on. " Baritones are big
stupid-heads. Altos are dopes."

00:20:00.460 --> 00:20:04.390
That's the reason this
bridge was sealed away.

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:05.860
Sera, you big stupid-head!

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:10.920
Marco, you dope! I'm never
gonna play with you again!

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:12.470
Same goes for me!

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:15.930
You big stupid-head!

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:17.760
You dope!

00:20:18.470 --> 00:20:21.240
It's a really long-
running KI D'S FIGHT?

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:23.000
Gimme a break...

00:20:23.480 --> 00:20:27.420
Well, at least we found
those magical vessels.

00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:29.610
Um, about those...

00:20:29.920 --> 00:20:32.390
We brought them together
a little too hard.

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:34.650
AGH! They're broken!

00:20:34.720 --> 00:20:36.120
Why, you!

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:39.250
Anyway, Lina, did you
grab that guy's weapon?

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:42.560
AGH! I forgot!
Oh, for crying out loud!

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:46.230
Anyway, we at least got a hint
on how to fight their weapon.

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:48.630
C'mon, let's start looking
for the next weapon.

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:49.730
Nothing fazes her.

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:51.300
No kidding.

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:52.670
Yeah, no kidding!

00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:54.000
Why?

00:20:56.810 --> 00:21:01.550
I'll get you all for the Boss!
I swear I'll get you!

00:22:21.930 --> 00:22:24.800
The final weapon is
in this creepy shrine?

00:22:25.170 --> 00:22:27.360
Well, why don't we check it out?

00:22:27.440 --> 00:22:30.740
Next time, " The Hurdle's Cleared?
Jillas's Hidden Power!"

00:22:30.810 --> 00:22:33.070
You'd better watch, or I'll
REALLY cause some trouble!
